RESET       reset
START       start
TEXT        Foe KYOGRE's DRIZZLE made it rain!
WEATHER     weather raindance
TEXT        GENGAR used CONFUSE RAY!
MOVE        anim Confuse Ray
STATUS_ANIM confusion anim
TEXT        Foe KYOGRE became confused!
TEXT        Foe KYOGRE used SURF!
MOVE        anim Surf
HIT         hit
HP          hp 55/100
TEXT        Rain continues to fall.
WEATHER     weather raindance (upkeep)
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew KYOGRE!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout DRAGONITE!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        GENGAR is confused!
STATUS_ANIM confusion anim
TEXT        GENGAR used THUNDERBOLT!
MOVE        anim Thunderbolt
HIT         hit
HP          hp 25/100
TEXT        It's super effective!
WEATHER     weather none
TEXT        The rain stopped.
TEXT        GENGAR, good!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go for it, SKARMORY!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        Foe DRAGONITE used WRAP!
MOVE        anim Wrap
HIT         hit
HP          hp 90/100
TEXT        SKARMORY was WRAPPED by\nFoe DRAGONITE!
ANIM        trap anim
TEXT        SKARMORY is hurt\nby WRAP!
HP          hp 84/100
TEXT        SKARMORY used SPIKES!
MOVE        anim Spikes
TEXT        SPIKES were scattered all around\nthe opponent's side!
TEXT        Foe DRAGONITE used THUNDER WAVE!
MOVE        anim Thunder Wave
STATUS      status par
TEXT        SKARMORY is paralyzed! It may be unable to move!
ANIM        item anim
TEXT        SKARMORY's CHERI BERRY\ncured paralysis!
STATUS      status none
ANIM        trap anim
TEXT        SKARMORY is hurt\nby WRAP!
HP          hp 78/100
TEXT        SKARMORY was freed\nfrom WRAP!
TEXT        Foe DRAGONITE used THUNDER WAVE!
MOVE        anim Thunder Wave
STATUS      status par
TEXT        SKARMORY is paralyzed! It may be unable to move!
TEXT        SKARMORY is paralyzed! It can't move!
STATUS      status anim
WEATHER     weather sandstorm
TEXT        A sandstorm brewed!
TEXT        The sandstorm rages.
WEATHER     weather sandstorm (upkeep)
TEXT        Foe DRAGONITE is buffeted\nby the sandstorm!
HIT         hit
HP          hp 19/100
ANIM        item anim
TEXT        SKARMORY's LEFTOVERS\nrestored its HP a little!
HP          hp 84/100
TEXT        SKARMORY used REST!
MOVE        anim Rest
TEXT        SKARMORY slept and\nbecame healthy!
STATUS      status slp
HP          hp 100/100
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew DRAGONITE!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout DUSCLOPS!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 2
TEXT        SKARMORY used CURSE!
MOVE        anim Curse
TEXT        Foe DUSCLOPS used CURSE!
MOVE        anim Curse
TEXT        Foe DUSCLOPS cut its own HP and laid a CURSE on SKARMORY!
TEXT        SKARMORY is afflicted\nby the CURSE!
STATUS_ANIM curse anim
HP          hp 75/100
TEXT        SKARMORY, that's enough!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go! GENGAR!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 0
TEXT        GENGAR's SHED SKIN\ncured its burn problem!
STATUS      status none
TEXT        Foe DUSCLOPS used NIGHT SHADE!
MOVE        anim Night Shade
HIT         hit
HP          hp 30/100
TEXT        GENGAR used SHADOW BALL!
MOVE        anim Shadow Ball
HIT         hit
HP          hp 5/100
TEXT        It's super effective!
TEXT        GENGAR, good!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Your foe's weak!\nGet 'em, SKARMORY!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        SKARMORY, that's enough!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Your foe's weak!\nGet 'em, GENGAR!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 0
ANIM        item anim
TEXT        GENGAR's LUM BERRY\ncured its poison problem!
STATUS      status none
TEXT        Foe DUSCLOPS used NIGHT SHADE!
MOVE        anim Night Shade
HIT         hit
HP          hp 0/100
FAINT       faint
TEXT        GENGAR fainted!
TEXT        Player lost against\n<trainer>!
END         end
